  message: "Staleness audit 2026-07-21: source (2) FIXED -- finalize.py:462-467 (WI-haguz) now sorts analysis_runs by (started_at, pass), so the as_completed() completion-order race the item cited is gone; the spec 'same input->same output' promise also moved §10->§13 scoped to ordering determinism. Live residuals: (a) source (1) -- ir.py:361 execution_id=uuid4 + 370 wall-clock started_at/duration still churn the whole-file byte diff; (b) spec:321 still asserts analysis_runs[] is 'byte-stable across runs', which is inaccurate given the fresh per-run uuid/timestamps. Re-scoped to those two."  # 7c06
